WEBVTT

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:43.043
You do not have the ultimate sentiment,

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:46.629
but let your sympathy make me your blade.

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:48.465
Stop it!

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:50.592
Stop it!

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:05.482
Zuellni?

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:08.902
Go?

00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.321
Where?

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.928
Where is this?

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:47.023
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:50.568
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:57.992
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:03.748
<i>Chizu o ushinatte samayotteiru machi</i>

00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:07.210
<i>Owariyuku sekai demo</i>

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:13.883
<i>Karada no oku de hashiru</i>
<i>no o yamenai inochi o kikasete</i>

00:02:13.883 --> 00:02:17.178
<i>Tayasanai hikari o tozasanai hitomi ni</i>

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:20.557
<i>Kawaitemo yakitsuketa</i>

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:27.188
<i>Kizutsuku koto mo naku</i>
<i>te ni suru mono nante nanimo shinjinai</i>

00:02:27.188 --> 00:02:33.111
<i>Dareka ni mukatta hitosuji no omoi wa</i>

00:02:33.111 --> 00:02:40.994
<i>Yoake no you ni hagane no yami o kirisaku</i>

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:45.331
<i>Itsuka brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:49.002
<i>Dakara tsuyoku kaeru</i>

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:54.966
<i>Kasaneta chikara mo inori mo</i>

00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:58.595
<i>Kousa suru mirai, kakaeta negai</i>

00:02:58.595 --> 00:03:02.015
<i>Dare no te ni mo watasenai</i>

00:03:02.015 --> 00:03:03.558
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:08.563
<i>Kokoro o tsuraneru</i>

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:23.411
Here they come.

00:03:23.411 --> 00:03:25.330
Juveniles, 500 of them.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.707
Not reading any other bioactivity.

00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:30.752
Felli, begin the next search.

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:33.213
It's my fault.

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:39.177
I shouldn't have told her to go.

00:03:39.761 --> 00:03:43.223
"Nina Missing! Zuellni in Crisis"

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:54.567
Restoration-02.

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:03.535
A group of contaminoids...
And we're already in their territory?

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:06.955
Yes. There have been
three encounters with juveniles

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:10.417
in the past two days.
Looking at the facts objectively...

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.085
And the electronic spirit?

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:13.920
It remains missing.

00:04:32.814 --> 00:04:34.107
Good work.

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:37.110
If you could finish the
adjustments quickly, please...

00:04:41.406 --> 00:04:45.368
Layfon, I could get a
single-bladed dite ready quickly,

00:04:45.368 --> 00:04:47.829
the one I made as an experiment.

00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:51.416
That should let you use
your full power. What do--

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:53.752
I'll take the same one as always!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.839
You should get a little rest.

00:04:58.131 --> 00:05:00.216
It's been three times since yesterday, right?

00:05:00.216 --> 00:05:02.635
Bein' needy like that will make a lady hate ya.

00:05:02.635 --> 00:05:04.262
Anything on Nina?

00:05:05.472 --> 00:05:07.098
Anything on Nina?!

00:05:08.183 --> 00:05:10.018
She's still missing.

00:05:12.729 --> 00:05:14.981
We go out in six hours.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.067
Please get everything ready.

00:05:17.067 --> 00:05:18.568
Hey!

00:05:19.861 --> 00:05:21.696
He can't rest.

00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:26.993
His heart. It will not rest.

00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:28.912
Felli!

00:05:29.037 --> 00:05:30.455
Felli!

00:05:37.462 --> 00:05:40.965
Well, this puts us smack into an odd situation.

00:05:41.716 --> 00:05:44.094
It's my very first holdup.

00:05:44.094 --> 00:05:48.306
It will be fine.
This is Myath, an academic city.

00:05:48.556 --> 00:05:52.185
They don't have the nerve to
suddenly start shooting.

00:06:06.616 --> 00:06:09.285
I'm telling you, I've got nothing to do with it!

00:06:09.285 --> 00:06:10.704
Huh?

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:22.257
Of course I know that. It's just,
what was stolen was extremely valuable.

00:06:22.257 --> 00:06:26.094
We have no choice but
to investigate this thoroughly.

00:06:26.469 --> 00:06:28.513
What was stolen?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.977
That's part of our investigation, and a secret.

00:06:36.855 --> 00:06:39.691
I truly am sorry about this.

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:42.152
You're being treated as if you're a criminal.

00:06:42.152 --> 00:06:43.069
Then why--

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:44.571
Let's get you...

00:06:44.988 --> 00:06:46.614
another one.

00:06:50.493 --> 00:06:53.121
In any case, I've got nothing to do with it.

00:06:53.121 --> 00:06:55.165
Can't I just get on the next bus?

00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:56.249
Now then...

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:58.084
What is this?

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:14.476
What is this?

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:17.145
Don't move!

00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:20.273
We're the municipal police!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.569
I won't go against those who protect the city.

00:07:27.572 --> 00:07:30.992
They can't clear me of suspicion
because I've got a dite.

00:07:30.992 --> 00:07:34.954
I'm not supposed to
leave the room except to eat.

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.873
You'll get fat, huh?

00:07:37.374 --> 00:07:39.876
You have no sense of delicacy.

00:07:39.876 --> 00:07:41.628
Is that so?

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:43.963
Now then...

00:07:45.256 --> 00:07:47.634
We're not finished yet.

00:07:48.051 --> 00:07:50.011
I win. Bye.

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:54.265
Only you?! That's cruel! Honestly...

00:07:54.683 --> 00:07:57.977
Just you watch. How's <i>this</i>?

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:01.815
I hate him.

00:08:05.235 --> 00:08:09.489
<i>The madness of an electronic</i>
<i>spirit that's lost its domain...</i>

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:11.491
<i>The Fallen Ones</i>.

00:08:12.075 --> 00:08:15.787
They can give military artists
superhuman power.

00:08:16.621 --> 00:08:18.039
Stronger...

00:08:18.248 --> 00:08:20.250
And even stronger.

00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:30.427
I won't let you do that.

00:08:37.892 --> 00:08:41.021
So, you're a genuine inhuman like me.

00:08:41.438 --> 00:08:44.357
Do you like your visit
to this foreign dimension?

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:48.737
I don't want to be
considered as being like you!

00:09:08.006 --> 00:09:10.008
<i>You'll get fat, huh?</i>

00:09:12.635 --> 00:09:14.471
You're putting it back?

00:09:14.888 --> 00:09:16.806
Can't say I'm too impressed.

00:09:16.806 --> 00:09:18.433
Um...

00:09:28.943 --> 00:09:30.779
You all right?

00:09:31.321 --> 00:09:33.156
Y-Yes.

00:09:34.991 --> 00:09:36.826
I'm sorry.

00:09:36.826 --> 00:09:40.580
On the contrary, I apologize if I startled you.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.000
It's okay. Um...

00:09:44.501 --> 00:09:49.005
I'm Leerin Marfes. May I ask your name?

00:09:49.005 --> 00:09:51.132
Leerin?

00:09:51.132 --> 00:09:54.511
No, I guess I'm mistaken.

00:09:54.511 --> 00:09:57.681
I'm Nina. Nina Antalk.

00:09:57.681 --> 00:10:01.768
Nina-<i>san</i>... Do you hate chick peas?

00:10:04.979 --> 00:10:06.606
Uh, no...

00:10:07.899 --> 00:10:10.151
So, what brought you here?

00:10:10.151 --> 00:10:11.861
Who knows?

00:10:12.737 --> 00:10:15.407
Before I knew it, this was where I'd ended up.

00:10:15.407 --> 00:10:19.411
Rather, someone told me
this is where I should come.

00:10:19.744 --> 00:10:21.913
Sorry. You probably don't understand.

00:10:21.913 --> 00:10:23.289
It's okay.

00:10:23.289 --> 00:10:25.417
Haven't you had a dream like that?

00:10:25.417 --> 00:10:28.420
You don't know why you are where you are,

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.422
but you have to do something.

00:10:30.422 --> 00:10:33.800
There's just that sense
of urgency... It's like that.

00:10:34.884 --> 00:10:36.886
One hundred pies!

00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:40.974
I don't know why, but in my dream,
customers are coming

00:10:40.974 --> 00:10:44.561
and I have to make
one hundred pies by myself.

00:10:44.561 --> 00:10:49.941
I always have that dream. And I think,
"Ah, <i>today </i>I have to bake them all."

00:10:49.941 --> 00:10:53.111
Yeah. It could be something like that.

00:10:53.111 --> 00:10:54.738
Also...

00:10:55.155 --> 00:10:58.867
I'm sorry. This is a strange thing to talk about...

00:10:58.867 --> 00:11:01.119
No, it's fun.

00:11:01.536 --> 00:11:05.623
Yeah... This kind of thing is fun.

00:11:05.623 --> 00:11:07.042
Yes.

00:11:24.392 --> 00:11:26.895
Another group of juveniles has been spotted.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:30.148
Number: unknown.
They will make contact in eighteen hours.

00:11:30.732 --> 00:11:32.108
How is Felli's condition?

00:11:32.108 --> 00:11:36.404
Sir. The exam results showed
fatigue due to prolonged nen'i use.

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:39.324
I see. Understood.

00:11:40.158 --> 00:11:43.620
One after another... What do we do?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:46.414
There is a limit to how
much we may rely on one man.

00:11:46.414 --> 00:11:50.043
We have no choice but to assemble
our platoons, tell them the truth.

00:11:51.211 --> 00:11:52.629
It will cause a panic.

00:11:52.629 --> 00:11:54.381
I won't let that happen.

00:11:54.631 --> 00:11:57.467
That's my job.

00:12:07.143 --> 00:12:08.770
Fon-Fon.

00:12:25.745 --> 00:12:27.497
So you're awake?

00:12:27.497 --> 00:12:29.499
You took your time.

00:12:31.334 --> 00:12:33.336
Ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:12:35.797 --> 00:12:37.382
You infuriate me.

00:12:37.799 --> 00:12:39.426
What does?

00:12:39.426 --> 00:12:41.469
You being there.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:46.975
If you have time,
you should be looking... For our leader.

00:12:46.975 --> 00:12:48.685
You're right.

00:13:00.405 --> 00:13:02.032
Fon-Fon!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:14.252
It's quite tame. I wonder if someone owned it.

00:13:14.252 --> 00:13:15.879
Say, Nina?

00:13:19.007 --> 00:13:20.508
This one?!

00:13:23.887 --> 00:13:26.723
All right, go back to your friends.

00:13:30.018 --> 00:13:32.437
Well then, shall we...

00:13:32.437 --> 00:13:34.356
What is it?

00:13:34.731 --> 00:13:36.775
It's strange.

00:13:37.317 --> 00:13:38.693
The bird?

00:13:38.693 --> 00:13:40.820
It's not trying to leave.

00:13:43.948 --> 00:13:45.575
What's that?

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:47.911
Those are all birds?!

00:13:55.210 --> 00:13:57.128
An electronic spirit!

00:14:00.006 --> 00:14:01.633
Nina-<i>san</i>!

00:14:05.762 --> 00:14:07.430
Hey, what's going on?

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.808
Hurry up and let us evacuate!

00:14:17.232 --> 00:14:18.650
So this is where you've been.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.236
Savalis-<i>san</i>, what is this?

00:14:21.236 --> 00:14:24.239
No doubt the contaminoids are approaching.

00:14:24.948 --> 00:14:26.366
Not to worry.

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:29.494
We, the military artists of Myath,

00:14:29.494 --> 00:14:32.622
will engage the contaminoids
with all our strength.

00:14:34.791 --> 00:14:36.418
Loi-<i>san</i>...

00:14:36.501 --> 00:14:38.753
Make your way to the shelter, calmly.

00:14:38.753 --> 00:14:40.380
All right.

00:14:43.925 --> 00:14:46.678
Hey! How long is that siren going to stay on?!

00:14:46.678 --> 00:14:47.637
Dunno.

00:14:47.637 --> 00:14:48.847
Make it stop!

00:14:48.847 --> 00:14:49.389
But...

00:14:49.389 --> 00:14:51.224
Do it now!

00:14:52.559 --> 00:14:53.935
Let's go.

00:14:53.935 --> 00:14:56.563
Huh? Wait.

00:14:56.563 --> 00:14:58.189
Hey!

00:15:02.861 --> 00:15:05.613
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:05.613 --> 00:15:09.034
I was told to let no harm at all come to you.

00:15:09.034 --> 00:15:10.493
By whom?

00:15:10.493 --> 00:15:11.870
You wanna know?

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:13.705
Not especially.

00:15:14.497 --> 00:15:15.999
What's that?

00:15:15.999 --> 00:15:17.625
Wait!

00:15:19.586 --> 00:15:21.296
That's an electronic spirit.

00:15:21.296 --> 00:15:22.297
"That" is?

00:15:22.297 --> 00:15:23.965
It's glowing, isn't it?

00:15:23.965 --> 00:15:26.468
Glowing? What is?

00:15:41.066 --> 00:15:44.277
Let her do as she likes
while protecting her, eh?

00:15:44.277 --> 00:15:46.488
What am I to do with her?

00:15:46.488 --> 00:15:48.281
Electronic spirits...

00:15:48.281 --> 00:15:52.327
I get it. If that's what were stolen,
it would all make sense.

00:15:54.037 --> 00:15:59.125
The way this city is on edge...
Why the city's legs have stopped...

00:15:59.834 --> 00:16:02.295
Maybe it's time to do whatever I want.

00:16:11.388 --> 00:16:12.722
Bastard!

00:16:12.722 --> 00:16:15.558
That power... Come with us...

00:16:15.558 --> 00:16:17.185
Nina Antalk.

00:16:17.185 --> 00:16:18.144
What was that?

00:16:18.144 --> 00:16:20.438
Would you not like to try changing the world?

00:16:20.438 --> 00:16:23.650
The Aurora Field makes that possible.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:29.739
Rigsario's ideology is but
dust before the dreams of Ignacius.

00:16:30.156 --> 00:16:32.617
Rigsario, you say?

00:16:34.953 --> 00:16:36.579
Hup!

00:16:45.672 --> 00:16:48.800
I get it. That's what has upset your friends.

00:16:58.768 --> 00:17:00.103
This, right?

00:17:00.103 --> 00:17:01.730
Hold on.

00:17:06.943 --> 00:17:08.862
Just a little more...

00:17:11.281 --> 00:17:12.699
Just...

00:17:19.497 --> 00:17:20.331
Loi-<i>san</i>!

00:17:20.331 --> 00:17:21.958
Hurry!

00:17:55.116 --> 00:17:58.745
This is... an electronic spirit.

00:17:59.162 --> 00:18:01.164
Good thing, huh?

00:18:10.965 --> 00:18:12.425
A gathering?

00:18:12.425 --> 00:18:17.263
Yes. For both leaders and below.
<i>All </i>platoon members.

00:18:17.931 --> 00:18:21.476
It looks like Layfon Alseif's
finally gotten rusty.

00:18:21.476 --> 00:18:25.313
And you still could not beat him.
That is your reality.

00:18:33.738 --> 00:18:35.573
Wait a moment.

00:18:36.783 --> 00:18:38.618
It hurts, doesn't it?

00:18:38.618 --> 00:18:41.037
Because of your tranquilizer gun!

00:18:41.037 --> 00:18:43.415
That gun doesn't have that sort of efficacy.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.877
You hurt your shoulder making up
for your back, which was operated on.

00:18:48.294 --> 00:18:49.796
Fighting is out of the question.

00:18:49.796 --> 00:18:53.925
Up till now it's been "Go!",
and now suddenly it's "Don't go"?

00:18:53.925 --> 00:18:56.469
Because up till now, it has been necessary.

00:18:56.469 --> 00:18:59.723
But our next encounter with
the contaminoids is yet to come.

00:18:59.723 --> 00:19:01.224
There is time.

00:19:01.224 --> 00:19:03.018
But no time for rest.

00:19:03.018 --> 00:19:04.269
Why not?

00:19:04.269 --> 00:19:08.356
Because sitting around here
doing nothing would be unforgivable!

00:19:08.356 --> 00:19:10.984
Why is it unforgivable?

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.779
Who would not forgive you?

00:19:15.196 --> 00:19:16.698
That's...

00:19:20.201 --> 00:19:21.703
Do not run away!

00:19:21.745 --> 00:19:24.873
Let me tell you why you cannot answer.

00:19:25.707 --> 00:19:28.543
You don't have a thought to spare
for this city's current condition.

00:19:28.543 --> 00:19:33.423
You are thinking neither of the
contaminoids nor of what lies ahead!

00:19:33.423 --> 00:19:34.799
That's not--

00:19:35.091 --> 00:19:40.305
You merely wish to escape from
the fact that Nina Antalk is not here!

00:19:46.978 --> 00:19:51.566
I will have you use your power for
Zuellni's sake, and when appropriate.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:01.451
You have relied far too much
on others for the reasons you fight.

00:20:06.414 --> 00:20:09.668
It was the only way to make him rest.

00:20:16.549 --> 00:20:20.595
You are all intelligent men and women,
and I'm sure you've noticed

00:20:20.595 --> 00:20:22.889
that we are facing a grave danger!

00:20:23.264 --> 00:20:27.060
This city is currently surrounded
by a group of contaminoids!

00:20:29.562 --> 00:20:30.939
However!

00:20:30.939 --> 00:20:33.358
It is far too soon for despair!

00:20:33.733 --> 00:20:38.446
Our platoon-class military artists
have already been apprised of the situation.

00:20:38.446 --> 00:20:41.491
They do not consider
our situation one of despair...

00:20:41.491 --> 00:20:44.911
Rather, they have pledged
to face this difficulty head-on!

00:20:45.245 --> 00:20:52.961
Their lives on the line,
they shall fight for Zuellni and for us...

00:20:52.961 --> 00:20:57.799
Would you see them off with
expressions of despair on your faces?

00:20:57.799 --> 00:21:02.721
They say great orators
never die pretty deaths, Kalian.

00:21:02.721 --> 00:21:06.182
That would be most emphatically unforgivable!

00:21:16.401 --> 00:21:18.028
Felli...

00:21:18.069 --> 00:21:22.657
I am forbidden from using nen'i
until my fatigue has passed.

00:21:22.657 --> 00:21:24.284
I see.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:29.873
But if you wish, I can send out
nen'i without using my terminal!

00:21:32.542 --> 00:21:37.547
If you wish, I will even count the
number of scales on each contaminoid!

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:41.134
If you wish it...

00:21:41.551 --> 00:21:43.845
I will do it.

00:21:47.515 --> 00:21:49.559
What shall I do?

00:22:00.153 --> 00:22:02.155
Nothing at all.

00:22:05.825 --> 00:22:07.452
Layfon.

00:22:26.262 --> 00:22:36.356
<i>Haikei, anata wa dare o omotteimasu ka</i>

00:22:36.356 --> 00:22:43.446
<i>Kono tegami wa mada mune no naka</i>

00:22:43.446 --> 00:22:53.498
<i>Totsuzen fureta anata no kioku no kakera</i>

00:22:53.498 --> 00:23:00.588
<i>Kokoro ni sasatte, ugokenai</i>

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:05.427
<i>Kizuite hoshii, kizukanaide</i>

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:09.139
<i>Tsumetaku suru no wa koi no sei? </i>

00:23:09.139 --> 00:23:18.732
<i>Tsutaetai yo, soba ni ite yo, demo ienai</i>

00:23:19.524 --> 00:23:28.116
<i>Yogoreta kono sekai de anata ni deaeta yo</i>

00:23:28.116 --> 00:23:39.294
<i>Watashi no kokoro ni maiorita</i>
<i>kiseki kanadete kudasai</i>

00:23:39.294 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>Ai no Zuellni</i>

00:23:53.725 --> 00:23:56.436
<i>Leerin and Nina have finally met,</i>
<i>in the academic city Myath.</i>

00:23:56.436 --> 00:23:57.562
<i>As a result of the contaminoids,</i>

00:23:57.562 --> 00:23:59.939
<i>the Fallen One inside</i>
<i>Nina will once again manifest.</i>

00:23:59.939 --> 00:24:02.442
<i>Meanwhile, in Zuellni,</i>
<i>preparations continue for a kei-ra blast</i>

00:24:02.442 --> 00:24:04.819
<i>meant to stop a group of contaminoids...</i>

00:24:04.819 --> 00:24:06.696
<i>Next time, "A Guided Encounter," and...</i>

00:24:06.696 --> 00:24:08.086
<i>Restoration!</i>
